            { text: "Therefore {DM} and {MG} are rational straight lines commensurable in square only.",
              visible: ALL,
              highlighted: ["DM","MG"] },
            { text: "Therefore {DG} is binomial.",
              visible: ALL,
              highlighted: ["DG"],
              justifications: [{ claim: "DG binomial", ref: "X.36" }] },
            { text: "I say next that it is a sixth binomial straight line.",
              visible: ALL,
              highlighted: ["DG"] },
            { text: "Similarly again we can prove that the rectangle {DK} by {KM} equals the square on {MN},",
